{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ad33b90e-bc9a-8799-938e-ce572e461356",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T14:02:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Doug Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, pardon me, is this the right place to report a problem with the road? A dip, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you're in the right spot. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:00:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, a while back they dug a trench across the road for a utility line. They filled it in and patched it, but it's settled since then. There's a dip now, maybe a few inches deep, running right across the lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a utility cut that's sunk down after the patch. Got it. Is it more of a dip or are there actual broken edges, like a pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:00:49-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly a dip. The edge of the patch is a little cracked, but it's the sinking that gets you. Pardon me, a neighbor of mine hit it too, last week. He said it jolted the whole car pretty hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:01:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, those are no fun. Did he have any damage, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:01:08-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He didn't say so. I think he was just surprised by it. It's hard to see, especially in the evening, because it's not very well lit along there. Well, except for one house. Somebody still has a very bright set of holiday lights up, and they light up half the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:01:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Noted, I'll just say it's tough to see at night. And what's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:01:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in front of 197 Old Beach Road. Down toward Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:01:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "197 Old Beach Road, utility trench settled, dip across the lane, neighbor hit it. Anything else I should put in there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just, pardon me, if you could add the street to the repair list. That's really what I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:01:52-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put in the request so it gets looked at and added. I can't tell you the exact day a crew will get out there, but it'll be in the system. Want me to take a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:02:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It's 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194. Got it. Anything else today, Doug?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:02:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:02:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
